{"ID":"20240206112152-yegfwdo","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240206112152-yegfwdo","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206112152-yegfwdo\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206112203-jl2ay5p\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206112158-ujumtdc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206112203-jl2ay5p\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:129,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:129\u0026#125;","title":"鸡蛋花","type":"doc","updated":"20240903092743"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206112203-jl2ay5p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206112203-jl2ay5p","updated":"20240206112206"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产云南、广东、福建、海南、台湾等地。\n【性状】\t干燥花朵，黄褐色至棕褐色，皱缩，主要为5枚大形旋转排列的花瓣。花瓣倒卵形，长约3cm，宽约1.5cm；下部合生成细管，长约1.5cm。内藏雄蕊5，花丝极短；有时可见小的卵状子房。气醇香，味清淡稍苦。\n【性味】\t甘，平。\n【功效】\t清热解暑、清肠止泻、止咳化痰。主治中暑、痢疾、腹痛、咳嗽。"}]},{"ID":"20240206112158-ujumtdc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206112158-ujumtdc","updated":"20240206112158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206112158-6q56pvb.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240730145933-enrfl81","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240730145933-enrfl81","updated":"20240730150419"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡蛋花 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡蛋花 9-20240730150419-zprtkdm.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 676px;","style":"width: 666px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡蛋花 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡蛋花 1-20240730145933-jooyaqa.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 666px;\" parent-style=\"width: 676px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240730145858-duldb7f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240730145858-duldb7f","updated":"20240730150048"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 679px;","style":"width: 669px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡蛋花"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡蛋花-20240730145858-ht4i4pm.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 669px;\" parent-style=\"width: 679px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 513px;","style":"width: 503px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡蛋花 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡蛋花 4-20240730150048-c932t8n.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 503px;\" parent-style=\"width: 513px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240730145952-putka2c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240730145952-putka2c","updated":"20240730150019"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 301px;","style":"width: 291px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡蛋花 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡蛋花 2-20240730145949-ad0sv1u.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 291px;\" parent-style=\"width: 301px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 778px;","style":"width: 768px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡蛋花 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡蛋花 3-20240730150019-whvq9co.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 768px;\" parent-style=\"width: 778px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240730150252-18uqd2u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240730150252-18uqd2u","updated":"20240730150358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 601px;","style":"width: 591px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡蛋花 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡蛋花 8-20240730150352-sj2bdo0.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 591px;\" parent-style=\"width: 601px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 600px;","style":"width: 590px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡蛋花 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡蛋花 7-20240730150252-fl3beni.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 590px;\" parent-style=\"width: 600px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240730150130-v6xtw5k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240730150130-v6xtw5k","updated":"20240730150211"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 392px;","style":"width: 382px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡蛋花 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡蛋花 5-20240730150130-00wqho5.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 382px;\" parent-style=\"width: 392px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 872px;","style":"width: 862px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡蛋花 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡蛋花 6-20240730150211-croyges.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 862px;\" parent-style=\"width: 872px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240730145831-ozx7h5c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240730145831-ozx7h5c","updated":"20240730152742"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：为夹竹桃科植物鸡蛋花的花朵或茎皮。（收录图片为黄花鸡蛋花）"}]},{"ID":"20240730145831-2famqnm","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240730145831-2famqnm"}},{"ID":"20240903092737-vf9mkxr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-vf9mkxr","updated":"20240903092743"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：鸡蛋花"}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-4se3nph","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-4se3nph","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鸡蛋花《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-0o9tvge","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-0o9tvge","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】JīDànHuā"}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-5e6m4r9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-5e6m4r9","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】缅栀子"}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-gc5xqsm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-gc5xqsm","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为夹竹桃科鸡蛋花属植物鸡蛋花PlumeriarubraL.cv.Acutifolia[P.rubraL.var.acutifolia（Poir.）Bailey;P.acuminataAit.]，以花入药。夏季采花，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-lu50ts6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-lu50ts6","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】甘，凉。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-2re9197","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-2re9197","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】清热解毒，利湿，止咳。用于预防中暑，肠炎，细菌性痢疾，消化不良，小儿疳积，传染性肝炎，支气管炎。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-jt1wkgg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-jt1wkgg","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】1～3钱。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-mnuwrvu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-mnuwrvu","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-do6g2ym","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-do6g2ym","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鸡蛋花《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-d9y1ska","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-d9y1ska","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】《岭南采药录》"}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-j6bchld","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-j6bchld","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】JīDànHuā"}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-z6fyz2n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-z6fyz2n","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】蛋黄花、擂捶花（《广东中药》Ⅱ），大季花（《广西药植名录》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-r01z6g4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-r01z6g4","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为夹竹桃科植物鸡蛋花的花朵。夏、秋采摘盛开的花朵，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-dua2aa8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-dua2aa8","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】"}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-esk4pse","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-esk4pse","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鸡蛋花，又名：缅栀子（《植物名实图考》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-h5o3kb6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-h5o3kb6","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"灌木至小乔木，高3～7米，有乳汁。小枝肥厚而多肉质，有叶聚生于顶。叶散生，具柄，矩圆形，长20～40厘米，宽达7厘米，两端渐狭，秃净，羽状脉，侧脉近边处连结成一边脉.聚伞花序顶生，花大，多数，极香；萼小，5裂，裂片钝头；花冠外面白色而略带淡红，内面基部黄色，长5～6厘米，裂片倒卵形，彼此覆盖，远较冠管为长；雄蕊5，着生于冠管基部，花药钝头，基部浑圆，与柱头分离：子房上位，心皮2，分离。蓇葖果，长圆形。花期8月。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-t1869c2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-t1869c2","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】栽培于庭园、花圃。分布广东、广西等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-hktx4qc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-hktx4qc","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】干燥花朵，黄褐色至棕褐色，皱缩，主要为5枚大形旋转排列的花瓣。花瓣倒卵形，长约3厘米，宽约1.5厘米；下部合生成细管，长约1.5厘米。内藏雄蕊5，花丝极短；有时可见小的卵状子房。气醇香，味清淡稍苦。以净花、干燥、色黄褐、气芳香者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-sx0neud","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-sx0neud","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】本品不详。其原种植物PlumeriarubraL.不同部位的水提取液对兔、豚鼠、猫、小鼠有局部麻醉及非特异性的解痉作用。树皮中含有白色结晶甙-喜蛋花甙，对粘膜无刺激，静脉注射后对呼吸、循环无影响，对离体子宫亦无直接作用，主要是泻下作用。人在临睡前口服0.2～0.3克，次晨可泻下1～2次，如剂量大于0.3克，还有利屎作用。叶、茎中的成分富瓦喜蛋花素1.5微克／毫升能抑制结核蓖的生长。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-68ztz21","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-68ztz21","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】《南宁市药物志》：\"甘，平，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-u3u2vv5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-u3u2vv5","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-hxh2aq2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-hxh2aq2","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《岭南采药录》：\"治湿热下痢，里急后重，又能润肺解毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-x398gq6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-x398gq6","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《南宁市药物志》：\"止咳。\""}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-4nv4wrn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-4nv4wrn","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，1.5～4钱。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-mab7ecy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-mab7ecy","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】治痢疾，夏季腹泻：鸡蛋花干品四至八钱，水煎服。（广州部队《常用中草药手册》）"}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-gxyjsn6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-gxyjsn6","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-l8ssn8n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-l8ssn8n","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鸡蛋花《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-vwu2pon","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-vwu2pon","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】出自《岭南采药录》。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-6tcdeq2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-6tcdeq2","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】JīDànHuā"}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-t48uw2m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-t48uw2m","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】缅栀子、蛋黄花、擂捶花、鸭脚木、大季花、番缅花、蕃花、善花仔"}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-4g6wajw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-4g6wajw","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-t6trrny","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-t6trrny","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为夹竹桃科植物鸡蛋花的花朵或茎皮。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-1jyxcvi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-1jyxcvi","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：PlumeriarubraL.cv.Acutifolia"}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-19pkb0w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-19pkb0w","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：夏、秋季采茎皮，花开时采花，晒干或鲜用。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-ygy39qx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-ygy39qx","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】落叶小乔木，高达5m。枝条粗壮肥厚肉质，全株具丰富乳汁。叶互生；叶柄长4-7.5cm，上面基部具腺体；叶片厚纸质，常聚集于枝上部，长圆状倒披针形或长椭圆形，长20-40cm，宽7-11cm，先端短渐尖，基部狭楔形，两面无毛；侧脉每边30-40条，未达叶缘网结成边脉。顶生聚伞花序，长16-25cm，宽约15cm；总花梗三歧，长11-18cm，肉质，绿色；花梗淡红色；花萼5裂，裂片小，卵圆形，不张开而压紧花冠筒；花冠外面白色，内面黄色，裂片狭倒卵形，向左覆盖，比花冠筒长1倍，花冠筒圆筒形，内面密被柔毛，喉部无鳞片；雄蕊5，着生于花冠筒基部，花丝极短，花药长圆形；心皮2，离生，花柱短，柱头长圆形，中间缢缩，先端2裂。蓇葖双生，广歧，圆筒形，向端部渐尖，长约11cm。种子斜长圆形，扁平，先端具长圆形膜质翅，翅长约2cm。花期5-10月，果期一般为7-12月。栽培者极少结果。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-o39mxyl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-o39mxyl","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】我国福建、台湾、广东、海南、广西、云南等地有栽培。原产墨西哥。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-rbe3ijx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-rbe3ijx","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-uxleath","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-uxleath","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状鉴别花多皱缩成条状，或扁平三角状，淡棕黄或黄褐色。湿润展平后，花萼较小。花冠裂片5，倒卵形，长约3cm，宽约1．5cm，呈旋转排列；下部合生成细管，长约1．5cm。雄蕊5，花丝极短。有时可见卵状子房。气香，味微苦。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-tdh1j7e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-tdh1j7e","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以花完整、色黄褐、气芳香者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-mco6t27","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-mco6t27","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】树皮中含α-香树脂醇（α-amyrin），β-香树脂醇（β-amyrin），β-谷甾醇（β-sitosterol），鸡蛋花甙（plumieride），东莨菪素（scopoletin）等[1]。根中含环烯醚萜类化合物：13－O-咖啡酰鸡蛋花甙（13－O-caffeoylplumieride），13-脱氧鸡蛋花甙（13-deoxyplumieride），β-二氧鸡蛋花新酸葡萄糖酯甙（β-dihydroplumericinicacidglucosyles-ter），1α-鸡蛋花甙（1α-plumieride），原鸡蛋花素（la-protoplumeri-cin）A，8-异鸡蛋花甙（8－isoplumieride）[2]。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-k0t1kpf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-k0t1kpf","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】从埃及产红鸡蛋花（Plumeriarubra）及粉红鸡蛋花（P．Rubravar.alba）根中分得抗菌成分鸡蛋花素（plumericin）等[1]，具有很强的抗真菌作用，对革兰阳性和阴性细菌以及结核杆菌都有明显抑制效果[2]。鸡蛋花甙对革兰阴性和阳性细菌也有显着抑制作用[3]。此外，鸡蛋花甙还有明显通便作用，对小鼠通便的ED50为0．12g／kg，患者于睡前服0．2～0．3g，次晨可泻下1～2次，剂量大于0．3g还有利尿作用。红鸡蛋花茎、皮、叶及带皮茎的水提取液对兔、豚鼠、猫和小鼠均有局麻作用和解痉作用[4]。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-wdfk5ov","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-wdfk5ov","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】采摘后，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-4201wex","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-4201wex","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】甘；微苦；性凉"}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-x66x5gk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-x66x5gk","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】肺；大肠经"}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-9knbr5u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-9knbr5u","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】清热；利湿；解暑。主感冒发热；肺热咳嗽；湿热黄疸；泄泻痢疾；尿路结石；预防中暑"}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-s4vb25x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-s4vb25x","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，花5～10g；茎皮10～15g。外用；适量，捣敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-9dbmwvj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-9dbmwvj","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】凡暑湿兼寒，寒湿泻泄，肺寒咳嗽，皆宜慎用。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-hx3rewj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-hx3rewj","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】"}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-yn3d6f7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-yn3d6f7","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《岭南采药录》：治湿热下痢，里急后重，又能润肺解毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-80ld48x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-80ld48x","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《南宁市药物志》：止咳。"}]},{"ID":"20240903092737-52b5lnu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092737-52b5lnu","updated":"20240903092754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240903092738-rjgksp4","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240903092738-rjgksp4","updated":"20240903092754"}},{"ID":"20240903092739-zyyob6w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092739-zyyob6w","updated":"20240903092754"}}]}